  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP-RCC Regional Electoral Support - Electoral Regional Component for Arab States</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP-RCC Regionala val support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida provided support to the Regional Project with an overall objective to enhance the credibility, transparency, effectiveness and sustainability of electoral institutions and procsses in the region. The&#xa0; objectives of the intervention were implemented under three key output results during the period from December 2013 to February 2017
1. Strengthened Regional Capacity and Knowledge on Electoral Issues.&#xa0;
2. Increased Participation of Women Throughout the Elctoral Cycle.&#xa0;
3. Formal and Informal Mechanisms in place to enable Youth Civil Society Organizations and Youth Civic Engagement in Govermnent Led and Other Political Processes.</narrative>
  </description>
